---
// About — MekongMind story + metrics
---

<section
  class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-white"
  aria-labelledby="about-heading"
>
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4 md:px-6 max-w-6xl">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-start">
      <div>
        <h2
          id="about-heading"
          class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-semibold text-slate-900 leading-snug mb-6"
        >
          Why MekongMind?
        </h2>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-base text-slate-600 leading-relaxed max-w-prose">
          <p>
            We built MekongMind because existing AI infrastructure tools are too complex, too expensive, and too locked-in. Most platforms force you into a single LLM provider, charge per-seat regardless of usage, and require months of integration.
          </p>
          <p>
            MekongMind is the opposite: bring your own API keys, pay only for what you use via Polar.sh, and get 25+ production-ready MCP tools out of the box. No lock-in, no hidden fees, no ops team required.
          </p>
          <p>
            Born on Apple Silicon (M1 Max, MLX), built for SEA startups and indie developers who ship fast and need reliable AI infrastructure without the enterprise tax.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 text-center shadow-sm">
          <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-sky-700">25+</div>
          <div class="text-sm text-slate-600 mt-1">MCP Tools</div>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 text-center shadow-sm">
          <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-sky-700">7</div>
          <div class="text-sm text-slate-600 mt-1">Providers Supported</div>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 text-center shadow-sm">
          <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-sky-700">93</div>
          <div class="text-sm text-slate-600 mt-1">Tests Passing</div>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 text-center shadow-sm">
          <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-sky-700">$0</div>
          <div class="text-sm text-slate-600 mt-1">To Start</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
